{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>I will lift My hand to the nations.</b> Like a person who lifts his hand and shows him, and likewise אָרִים נִסִּי (I will lift my banner), and the meaning is that I will make known this salvation:" "<b>And they shall bring.</b> The nations [will bring] your sons:" "<b>In the bosom.</b> Like גַּם חֲצָנִי נְעַרְתִּי (Nehemiah 5:13):"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:58:49.198630384Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}